law.text:
		Unless otherwise prohibited by law or regulation, the professional services defined in subsection A of § 13.1-1102 may be rendered in this Commonwealth by:

A limited liability company organized as a professional limited liability company pursuant to the provisions of this chapter;


A foreign limited liability company that has obtained a certificate of authority pursuant to the provisions of this chapter;


A limited liability company organized pursuant to the provisions of Chapter 12 (§ 13.1-1000 et seq.) of this title; or


A foreign limited liability company that has obtained a certificate of authority pursuant to the provisions of Chapter 12 (§ 13.1-1000 et seq.) of this title.
